## 🚀 How to Use

If you ever need to set up a brand-new Supabase PostgreSQL database:
1. Open the SQL Editor on your Supabase dashboard.
2. Copy and paste the contents of [10_complete_database.sql](file:///c:/Users/DELL/Desktop/BVC-Event-Attendance-System-Supabase/database_snapshot/10_complete_database.sql).
3. Execute the script to generate the entire schema, tables, constraints, indexes, triggers, views, RLS policies, and core seed data.
